All files authored for this package (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0): app.py, ui.html, goal-prompt.md, seed.py, selftest.py, setup.sh, README.md.
No third-party code is bundled. Python standard library only (sqlite3). Optional database drivers
(psycopg — LGPL-3.0, pymysql — MIT) are installed by the operator and are not part of this package.
sample/research.db is synthetic dummy data generated by seed.py.

LLM (not bundled): called via an OpenAI-compatible API; default deployment is Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, MIT)
  serving Google Gemma 4 (gemma4:31b, Apache-2.0 — https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license).
  setup.sh pulls qwen3:8b (Apache-2.0) only when the Ollama server has no model.

